{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"33348","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v38604","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"水島☆多也","creatorId":"vndb:s576","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:130","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s576","name":"水島☆多也","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:257170","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"金目鯛ぴんく","creatorId":"vndb:s901","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:156","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s901","name":"金目鯛ぴんく","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:257171","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"相川亜利砂(あいかわ亜利砂)","creatorId":"vndb:s2040","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:142","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2040","name":"相川亜利砂(あいかわ亜利砂)","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:257172","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"吉野恵子","creatorId":"vndb:s2157","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:322","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2157","name":"吉野恵子","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:257173","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"麿","creatorId":"vndb:s907","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2123","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s907","name":"麿","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:257174","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"大津菜美","creatorId":"vndb:s909","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:14908","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s909","name":"大津菜美","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:257175","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"紺乃瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s914","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:22193","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s914","name":"紺乃瑞樹","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:257176","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"首藤頼多(高橋冷夢、内藤自由、始門弦武)","creatorId":"vndb:s2772","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:204","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2772","name":"首藤頼多(高橋冷夢、内藤自由、始門弦武)","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:257177","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"盃 湊","creatorId":"vndb:s40013","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s40013","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s40013","name":"盃 湊","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:189470","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"信楽こころ","creatorId":"vndb:s35148","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:38984","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s35148","name":"信楽こころ","detail":"主題歌「白無垢鉄火」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:258814","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"KIZAWA studio","creatorId":"vndb:s592","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s592","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s592","name":"KIZAWA studio","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:189461","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"信楽こころ","creatorId":"vndb:s35148","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s35148","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s35148","name":"信楽こころ","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:189469","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c116553","characterName":"藍原 果耶","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"117691","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"403269"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24374"],"vndbCharacterId":"c116553"},"originalCharacterName":"藍原 果耶","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aihara Kaya is a 1st year student. Despite her small body, she is capable of audaciously telling her seniors what she thinks. She is especially combative towards people she takes for enemies, at whom she even might swear. To say she is earnest would be a compliment, but she has a tendency to strive relentlessly towards her goal once she is bent on doing something."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although it sounds good to say that she is determined, she tends to go off the rails when she gets her mind set on something."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she admires Mafuyu as a wonderful upperclasman, she is not at all interested in Souji -- Rather, she has been suspicious of him for a long time now, thinking he is not a suitable boyfriend for Mafuyu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After Souji's suspension, she starts following Mafuyu around and repeatedly interrupts and insults Souji."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c116553"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に生意気な後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さな身体に見合わず気が強く、目上の相手にも怖じけず自分の意見をぶつけることができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に敵と見なした相手にはすこぶる攻撃的になり、罵詈雑言を浴びせてしまうことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一途と言えば聞こえはいいが、思い込んだら一直線に暴走しがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞冬のことは素敵な先輩として憧れていた一方で、主人公のことは舞冬の恋人として不適格だと思っており、前々から怪しんでいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"停学後、舞冬に付きまとうようになった主人公を何度も邪魔し、辛辣な言葉をぶつけるようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24374","sourceWorkId":"33348","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常狂妄的后辈。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与娇小的身体有反差，气势很强，能毫不畏惧地向长辈宣泄自己的意见。特别是对被视为敌人的对方，会变得非常具有攻击性，甚至会破口大骂。虽然应该夸她是非常一心一意坚持的人，但也应该说是一根筋认死理的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一直将舞冬作为优秀的前辈憧憬着，认为男主不适合作为舞冬的恋人，很久以前就很怀疑。面对停学后，多次打扰纠缠着舞冬的男主，喷出了尖酸恶毒的话语。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【日语】非常に生意気な後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さな身体に見合わず気が強く、目上の相手にも怖じけず自分の意見をぶつけることができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に敵と見なした相手にはすこぶる攻撃的になり、罵詈雑言を浴びせてしまうことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一途と言えば聞こえはいいが、思い込んだら一直線に暴走しがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞冬のことは素敵な先輩として憧れていた一方で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことは舞冬の恋人として不適格だと思っており、前々から怪しんでいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"停学後、舞冬に付きまとうようになった主人公を何度も邪魔し、辛辣な言葉をぶつけるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【bugbug版】与娇小的身材不服的强气，不俱强权，无论对谁都能说出自己的意见。特别对自己敌视的人会很有攻击性，会言语辱骂对方。说好听点该说是直性子，但也很容易暴走。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"117691"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"117691","value":"1年生"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24374","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24374","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"153 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24374","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24374","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24374","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0cd96cdf2d843215d14633c7726c0f80475f3e67ec99f5c95ae8635d0e276af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/2355db844043bf6ab1443d5590d323aa8bc7bb18d9d1dbccf63222d4599faf4e.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小澤みのり","creatorId":"vndb:s15910","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15910","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15910","name":"小澤 みのり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:403269:117691:32659:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c116556","characterName":"吉宮 舞冬","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"117690","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"403269"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24373"],"vndbCharacterId":"c116556"},"originalCharacterName":"吉宮 舞冬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yoshimiya Mafuyu, a 2nd year student. The wealthy daughter of a major company executive and Souji's ex-girlfriend. She doesn't act high and mighty, and is modest and full of praise for people's good sides. After confessing to Souji, she enjoyed a good relationship with him. However, she decided to cut their relationship short after he got suspended from school because of a false accusation."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c116556"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の元彼女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優等生然とした振る舞いと美貌で、周囲からは一目置かれる存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上場企業経営者の娘として生まれたお嬢様だが偉ぶることもなく謙虚で、よく人のいい所を見つけて褒める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"対人関係は男女問わずそつなく良好で、アイドル的な人気を誇っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞冬から告白する形で主人公の恋人になり、関係も良好だったが、濡れ衣で停学処分を受けた彼に一方的に別れを告げて交際を解消する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24373","sourceWorkId":"33348","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公的前女友，以优等生的举止和美貌，被周围的人刮目相看的存在。虽然是上市公司经营者的女儿出生的大小姐，但毫不自大，谦虚，经常找别人的好地方来表扬。无论男女，人际关系都很好，拥有偶像般的人气。自舞冬以告白的形式成为男主的恋人之后，关系一直很好。与因冤枉而受到停学处分的男主单方面告知，解除交往关系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【日语】主人公の元彼女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優等生然とした振る舞いと美貌で、周囲からは一目置かれる存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上場企業経営者の娘として生まれたお嬢様だが偉ぶることもなく謙虚で、よく人のいい所を見つけて褒める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"対人関係は男女問わずそつなく良好で、アイドル的な人気を誇っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞冬から告白する形で主人公の恋人になり、関係も良好だったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"濡れ衣で停学処分を受けた彼に一方的に別れを告げて交際を解消する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【bugbug版】主角的元女友。大型企业经营者的女儿，生为大小姐不盛气凌人保持谦虚，善于发现别人优点并加以赞赏。是舞冬向主人公告白，两人发展成恋人，虽然关系良好，但是当主人公被冤枉停学后又单方面要求分手。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"117690"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"117690","value":"2年生"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24373","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24373","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24373","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24373","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24373","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3ff2ceb228a5ed1400983428beca019da6a04bdff1cf225a694b17301f8f12a9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6aecdeb4ce91e14742336479e74fcaffb98c7ce9a891e4a79bee58bca5083f42.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝比奈幸","creatorId":"vndb:s21648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21648","name":"朝比奈 幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:403269:117690:17080:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"綾音 まこ","creatorId":"vndb:s2581","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2581","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2581","name":"綾音 まこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92902","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c116790","characterName":"都坂 紬","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["24376"],"vndbCharacterId":"c116790"},"originalCharacterName":"都坂 紬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tosaka Tsumugi is the chairman of the Discipline Committee, who aims for a bright and clean school life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a cheerful, kind and mature personality, like that of a doting older sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsumugi has a charming smile and is always joking around, which naturally attracts people to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though she and Souji were neighbors and childhood friends and had a close relationship when they were little, she now has a cold attitude toward Souji after he became a delinquent."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c116790"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく清らかな学園生活を目指す風紀委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お節介焼きのお姉さんのような、朗らかで優しい大人びた性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"笑顔が魅力的で気軽に冗談もいったりするなど、自然と人を惹き付ける学園の人気者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは近所づきあいのある幼なじみの関係で、子供の頃はそれなりに関わりを持っていたが、不良になった現在の主人公には愛想を尽かして冷たい態度を取る。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24376","sourceWorkId":"33348","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24376","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24376","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"161 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24376","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24376","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"61 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24376","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c60497d9a07696d11540da9703e9a075ce3c6eadf129b65dac323eb16122403b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc1a61ed2a47f5153da98ff9bd591c19162ed6bec02e35f91e3c8d53d8855778.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瀬名 ゆず希","creatorId":"vndb:s443","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s443","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s443","name":"美月(声優)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92903","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c116791","characterName":"湖條 ヒスイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"117692","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"403269"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24375"],"vndbCharacterId":"c116791"},"originalCharacterName":"湖條 ヒスイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"93"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kojou Hisui, who was raised to be a proper lady, was born into a prominent family that donates a great deal of money to the school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to the environment in which she was raised, she takes it for granted that the people around her follow her lead, and treats her fellow students as if they were her servants."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hisui is honest about who she is, and while she is openly fond of what she likes, she hates what she does not. She is a true believer in the good and the bad."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With a personality that is open and honest in both good and bad ways, and thanks to her differing values of those from the commons, she causes all sorts of problems, but she never gets in trouble."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Souji is the only person in the school who does not obey her, and she has a hard time understanding him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After his suspension, she starts to accuse Souji of stalking Mafuyu whenever she sees him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of Hisui's strong influence, Souji's reputation spreads at an accelerated pace, which undermines him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c116791"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園に多大な寄付をしている名士の家に生まれ、蝶よ花よと育てられてきた生粋のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"育ってきた環境のせいで周りの人間は自分に従って当然だと思っており、学園の人間のことも召使いのように扱う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とにかく自分に素直であり、好きなものには真っ当に好感を示すが、嫌いなものはとことん嫌う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良い意味でも悪い意味でも裏表がない性格で、価値観が一般人とは違うために様々な問題行動を起こすが本人に一切悪気はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園内で唯一自分に従わない主人公のことは、以前から理解できず突っかかっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"停学後の主人公には、事あるごとに舞冬へのストーカー行為の疑惑を取り上げて非難するようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強い影響力を持つヒスイが声を大にして主人公を貶めたことで、主人公の悪評は加速度的に広まっていってしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24375","sourceWorkId":"33348","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"出生于对学园捐赠颇多的名流之家，被培育成蝴蝶和花那般纯粹的大小姐。由于成长环境的原因，认为周围的人顺从自己是理所当然的事，并把学院里的人当成了仆人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总而言之，对自己坦率，喜欢的东西会完全表示好感，但讨厌的东西就彻底讨厌了。她的性格说好也罢说坏也罢，总之就是表里如一，因为价值观和普通人不同可造成了各种各样的问题，但本人完全没有恶意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她总是很难理解男主，因为他是学校里唯一不服从她的人，所以长期以来一直在锐评吐槽男主。对于停学后的男主，每次有事都会疑惑男主对舞冬的跟踪狂行为并进行谴责。由于具有强大影响力的她对男主的贬低，使得男主的恶评加速传播开来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【日语】学園に多大な寄付をしている名士の家に生まれ、蝶よ花よと育てられてきた生粋のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"育ってきた環境のせいで周りの人間は自分に従って当然だと思っており、学園の人間のことも召使いのように扱う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とにかく自分に素直であり、好きなものには真っ当に好感を示すが、嫌いなものはとことん嫌う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良い意味でも悪い意味でも裏表がない性格で、価値観が一般人とは違うために様々な問題行動を起こすが本人に一切悪気はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園内で唯一自分に従わない主人公のことは、以前から理解できず突っかかっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"停学後の主人公には、事あるごとに舞冬へのストーカー行為の疑惑を取り上げて非難するようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強い影響力を持つヒスイが声を大にして主人公を貶めたことで、主人公の悪評は加速度的に広まっていってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【bugbug版】出生于对学园捐赠巨大的名人世家，被培育成蝴蝶和花一样的贵千金。总之对自己坦率，对喜欢的东西表现出确实的好感，但讨厌的东西也是坦率的讨厌。由于具有强大影响力的她对男主的贬低，使得男主的恶评加速传播开来。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"117692"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"117692","value":"2年生"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24375","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24375","sourceWorkId":"33348","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24375","sourceWorkId":"33348","sou